--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The GeoMap surface depends on `mapbox-gl`, which is NOT open source. It is
licensed under the Mapbox Terms of Service, not an OSI licence:

  Copyright (c) Mapbox, Inc. All rights reserved.
  Licensed under the Mapbox TOS — https://www.mapbox.com/legal/tos/
